- **Front Hub Compatibility**: Same as 2002–present CRF450R with standard rotor  
- **Rear Hub Compatibility**: Same as 2009–2012 models  
- **Front Axle Diameter**: 20mm  
- **Rear Axle Diameter**: 25mm  
- **Spacer Kit Part Number**: Refer to Honda 2009–2012 spec kits  
- **Spoke/Nipple Compatibility**: Front: 36 spokes / Rear: 32 spokes  
- **Wheel Size (Stock)**: Front: 21” / Rear: 19”  
- **Rim Width (Stock)**: Front: 1.60” / Rear: 2.15”

